{"data": [{"author_id": "2113935499534499840", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:03:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116274883596521816"], "id": "2116274883596521816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "eToro: Caught in the Chip Storm\n6 more buys: TSMC, Nvidia, ASML, Amazon, Broadcom &amp; Meta.\nThen Intel's outlook sank the chips.\nSince Thursday: −2.79% vs S&amp;P −1.69%. 7 days: −2.56% vs −0.98%.\nOne green line: AstraZeneca +7.7%.\nNot investment advice. https://t.co/2z8G6xtPyz", "url": "https://x.com/ThePort_Manager/status/2116274883596521816"}, {"author_id": "728045299", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:18:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116278596054782421"], "id": "2116278596054782421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先端パッケージング技術「CoWoS(コワース:Chip on Wafer on Substrate)」", "url": "https://x.com/mammarumathtoy/status/2116278596054782421"}, {"author_id": "1437031529226506246", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:44:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116285235109449939"], "id": "2116285235109449939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【10月31日｜AI没有崩盘，华尔街正在重新定价整个科技行业】\n\n昨晚美股出现了一场值得认真研究的科技股抛售。纳指下跌2.86%，标普下跌1.82%，$INTC暴跌28.6%，$AMD下跌10.9%，$NVDA下跌4.2%。\n\n今天的X", "url": "https://x.com/wlvl22/status/2116285235109449939"}, {"article": {"title": "中国のNVIDIA、中国のAMD、中国のAWSはどの会社？ AIチップ企業をポジションマップで整理"}, "author_id": "1190498579128864768", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:26:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116280637422526650"], "id": "2116280637422526650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIAの輸出規制を受けた中国は、国内生産に舵をきり、数年前は95%もあったNVIDIAのシェアは34%に低下しました。\n\n中国で伸びるAIチップ企業は、アメリカで言えばどの会社か？ https://t.co/z4a3PCQrr1", "url": "https://x.com/KATSU47096277/status/2116280637422526650"}, {"author_id": "246457098", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:00:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116289105503916435"], "id": "2116289105503916435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Silicon Creations Receives 10th Consecutive TSMC OIP Partner of the Year Award for Mixed Signal IP\nRecognition reflects over 15 years of collaboration and production success supporting customers across advanced TSMC process technologies https://t.co/c0MNI54hRh https://t.co/4DZw9l3JQd", "url": "https://x.com/chipestimate/status/2116289105503916435"}, {"author_id": "216202215", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:58:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116288643136688596"], "id": "2116288643136688596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "America calibrates Taiwan's defense capabilities with \"weapons delays.\"\n\nWe want them hardened enough to prevent Chinese invasion (for now), scared enough to pressure TSMC to (slowly bc of politics) decentralize ops.\n\nOnce TSMC sufficiently out, cut a win-win deal w/ the CCP. https://t.co/GqgBPdCeHQ", "url": "https://x.com/ancerj/status/2116288643136688596"}, {"author_id": "92069284", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:12:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277047219703868"], "id": "2116277047219703868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3077, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "1918987204715487383", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$ASML #ASML uiteindelijk x3 gegaan binnen een veel sneller tijdspad! Dit niveau houd ik goed in de gaten.... https://t.co/RO6VPbSWZy https://t.co/wMlQIV169j", "url": "https://x.com/JDB_trading/status/2116277047219703868"}, {"author_id": "1142138559777902594", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116273767177392140"], "id": "2116273767177392140", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 414, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116267261728096377", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Altman ile Liu görüştü, sonra TSMC yönetimiyle de görüşmesi oldukça olası.\n\nFoxconn görüşmesi AI sunucuları ve veri merkezi altyapısı açısından, olası TSMC görüşmesi ise doğrudan çip üretim kapasitesi açısından kritik. https://t.co/YhJ9lVCkTv", "url": "https://x.com/bariscanyazici/status/2116273767177392140"}, {"author_id": "728045299", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:26:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116280690904014911"], "id": "2116280690904014911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI半導体に不可欠な積層メモリ「HBM」", "url": "https://x.com/mammarumathtoy/status/2116280690904014911"}, {"author_id": "2007187826316849152", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:52:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116287165109772601"], "id": "2116287165109772601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hanmi Semiconductor Hits 50% Operating Margin on HBM TC Bonder Surge\n\nVik: TC bonders stay lucrative only as long as HBM stays on thermocompression and not hybrid bonding - and near term I’m with the crowd that high hybrid bonded stacks cost too much. https://t.co/y3nsQixvOV", "url": "https://x.com/semidoped/status/2116287165109772601"}, {"author_id": "1373569238061912069", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:12:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277067688099861"], "id": "2116277067688099861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 610, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\nI．AI投資と市場評価：売上成長に加え、現金回収と利益への転換が問われる\n\n　大型CSPのAI投資を巡る懸念は、\n　　投資額そのものから、\n　　　支出に見合う利益・現金を\n　　　　回収できるかへ広がっている。", "url": "https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2116277067688099861"}, {"author_id": "1062441995832975360", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:20:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116279099228668309"], "id": "2116279099228668309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "America’s New Chip Factory That TSMC Depends On\nhttps://t.co/CtpHC9tjOY", "url": "https://x.com/surfcitybob1/status/2116279099228668309"}, {"author_id": "728045299", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:28:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116281069737849170"], "id": "2116281069737849170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "簡単に例えるなら「既製服」だったHBMが、顧客ごとの「オーダーメイド服」になるのだ。", "url": "https://x.com/mammarumathtoy/status/2116281069737849170"}, {"author_id": "29506590", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:27:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116280964687245624"], "id": "2116280964687245624", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One in 46 babies in Taiwan is born to a TSMC employee", "url": "https://x.com/nickschulz/status/2116280964687245624"}, {"author_id": "2388790596", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116289127414895087"], "id": "2116289127414895087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sk Hynix restituisce 75 miliardi di dollari agli azionisti dopo utili record trainati dall’Ia, ma avverte anche che la crisi di chip Hbm e Dram durerà fino al 2030.\n\nhttps://t.co/ITLykKczIf", "url": "https://x.com/StartMagNews/status/2116289127414895087"}, {"author_id": "1979288764313931779", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:33:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116282358307619208"], "id": "2116282358307619208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1833, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115922624274403572", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Quiz: So, who do you think has secured a big chunk of Samsung’s HBM supply right now? 👀 https://t.co/gjzSJyYAjA", "url": "https://x.com/damnang2/status/2116282358307619208"}, {"author_id": "1882178521553846272", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:47:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116285992286261395"], "id": "2116285992286261395", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116119877790662823", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "la burbuja mas anunciada de la historia, la unica barrera para el avance y la constante inyeccion de guita es en la produccion de chips, se solucionara cuando China termine de copiar las maquinas de ASML, el uso se disparara, cada vez mas barato correrlos https://t.co/67udC2aw4s", "url": "https://x.com/Leiitx_/status/2116285992286261395"}, {"author_id": "2087230434539110400", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:00:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116274164499923428"], "id": "2116274164499923428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rep. Kevin Hern sold up to $50,000 of $ASML on Oct 23, 2026 and disclosed it on Oct 28, 2026, 5 days later. It is up 6.6% since.\nhttps://t.co/CNIRk2aahj", "url": "https://x.com/InstaportAI/status/2116274164499923428"}, {"author_id": "132469038", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:06:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116275560045514855"], "id": "2116275560045514855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 336, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116096171387072740", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "インテルはもはや不可欠な存在ではない。CPUはAMDがある。ファウンダリーはTSMCがある。PCユーザーには機能アップ、バージョンアップはむしろ迷惑。インテルは依然強力な財務基盤、技術基盤を持つが5年後にどうなっているかは、相当不安。 https://t.co/PyX2wf4sTe", "url": "https://x.com/realwavebaba/status/2116275560045514855"}, {"author_id": "728045299", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:27:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116280852988711420"], "id": "2116280852988711420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HBMとは、DRAMチップを高層ビルのように積み上げ、GPUに大量のデータを超高速で供給するメモリを指す。", "url": "https://x.com/mammarumathtoy/status/2116280852988711420"}, {"author_id": "1338428477146480640", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:34:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116282503762002305"], "id": "2116282503762002305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Fxcking.G.M🦈\nダウ572ドル安、S◯X7.2%急落\nインテル28%安や黒石の資金調達懸念が飛び火\nAI開発側の信用ノイズと、NVDA・TSMCが持つ物理的ボトルネックを分離\n感情的投げ売りが作る構造的歪みをスケベ指値で狭射せよ\n\nエエ感じに下げてきた。ハニトラ革ジャンか、台湾セミ、はたまたS◯XLで博打か", "url": "https://x.com/M80LpDcFgglC2Rz/status/2116282503762002305"}, {"author_id": "2067640128105824256", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116285655814897681"], "id": "2116285655814897681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1229, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "HOLY COW! \n\n$AAPL just overtook $NVDA to become the most valuable company in the world, crossing $5 TRILLION in market cap!\n\nWall Street is selling practically EVERYTHING related to AI and the semiconductor trade right now. \n\nNVIDIA is down over 4%, TSMC nearly 6%, and even https://t.co/QrgCBiyIbx", "url": "https://x.com/MelvinInvests/status/2116285655814897681"}, {"author_id": "3183376597", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:22:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116279629099184364"], "id": "2116279629099184364", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116228961160319350", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Serious Question!\n\nWhose interested in pooling resources and building a second TSMC? \n\nI'm tired of this! Yes, Datacenters need RAM. But so does every device that you use to access the services that run in datacenters. \n\nIt's not my fault that Microsoft, Apple, and Linux keep https://t.co/j8LdMqoW9X", "url": "https://x.com/TDSheridanLab/status/2116279629099184364"}, {"author_id": "1790868238949339137", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:58:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116288673742471212"], "id": "2116288673742471212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 230, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 반도체 급락, AI 수요가 무너진 것인가?\nSEMICONDUCTOR MARKET SHOCK\nAI 성장과 반도체 산업의 새로운 위험\n\n10월 30일 미국 증시에서 필라델피아 반도체지수(SOX)가 약 7.2% 급락했습니다.\n\n나스닥은 2.86% 하락했습니다.\n\n저는 이번 반도체 급락을 단순한 차익실현으로만 보지 않습니다.", "url": "https://x.com/jinseongeo83473/status/2116288673742471212"}, {"author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:15:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277844716163469"], "id": "2116277844716163469", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "삼성전자가 3분기 영업이익 107.4조원을 기록했다.\n\nDS 부문만 106.5조원으로 마진이 72%대였다.\n\nHBM4 매출이 전 분기보다 3배 넘게 늘었고 전체 HBM의 60%를 차지했다고 한다. 2027년 물량은 이미 소진됐다.\n\nSK하이닉스는 고객 요청이 공급의 2배를 넘는다고 했고 2029년까지 사실상 다 팔렸다고", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2116277844716163469"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2113935499534499840", "name": "The Portfolio Manager", "username": "ThePort_Manager"}, {"id": "728045299", "name": "mammarumathtoy", "username": "mammarumathtoy"}, {"id": "1437031529226506246", "name": "骤言WLVL", "username": "wlvl22"}, {"id": "1190498579128864768", "name": "KATSU", "username": "KATSU47096277"}, {"id": "246457098", "name": "ChipEstimate", "username": "chipestimate"}, {"id": "216202215", "name": "José Ancer", "username": "ancerj"}, {"id": "92069284", "name": "JDB", "username": "JDB_trading"}, {"id": "1142138559777902594", "name": "Barış Yazıcı", "username": "bariscanyazici"}, {"id": "2007187826316849152", "name": "Semi Doped", "username": "semidoped"}, {"id": "1373569238061912069", "name": "シェットランドシープドッグ", "username": "Nikola_pn2501"}, {"id": "1062441995832975360", "name": "surfcitybob", "username": "surfcitybob1"}, {"id": "29506590", "name": "Nick Schulz", "username": "nickschulz"}, {"id": "2388790596", "name": "Start Magazine", "username": "StartMagNews"}, {"id": "1979288764313931779", "name": "Damnang", "username": "damnang2"}, {"id": "1882178521553846272", "name": "Leonel", "username": "Leiitx_"}, {"id": "2087230434539110400", "name": "Instaport", "username": "InstaportAI"}, {"id": "132469038", "name": "馬場正博", "username": "realwavebaba"}, {"id": "1338428477146480640", "name": "あるふぁ🦈", "username": "M80LpDcFgglC2Rz"}, {"id": "2067640128105824256", "name": "Melvin", "username": "MelvinInvests"}, {"id": "3183376597", "name": "Terry Sheridan", "username": "TDSheridanLab"}, {"id": "1790868238949339137", "name": "Mr. Jin", "username": "jinseongeo83473"}, {"id": "1614608796973928448", "name": "RichDorai", "username": "Richdorai"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116289127414895087", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzly33rdjw0sy4c4lell0wqdnxful", "oldest_id": "2116273767177392140", "result_count": 25}}
